OL,3,GNEWSABuilding site noise is 'damaging
OL,4,Aquality of life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has said her health is being
OL,7,Fimpacted by noise from a construction
OL,8,Fsite near her home.
OL,10,FAna Fernandes, who lives on Mont Arrive
OL,11,Fin Guernsey, and works night shifts at
OL,12,Fthe island hospital, said: "I'm always
OL,13,Ftired because I haven't been sleeping
OL,14,Fproperly due to the noise and that will
OL,15,Faffect my work."
OL,17,FNick Reid, director of C8 Mechanical &
OL,18,FElectrical which oversees the site,
OL,19,Fsaid it expected the major external
OL,20,Fphases of the project to be finished
OL,21,Fover the next two weeks.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
