OL,3,GNEWSABuilding site noise is 'damaging
OL,4,Aquality of life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe added: "We are fully aware of the
OL,7,Fdisruptions that construction can cause
OL,8,Fand we work strictly within approved
OL,9,FEnvironmental Health guidelines and
OL,10,Fhours to minimise impact."
